        <p class="lp-section-desc">
          Enten du leier ut eller leier, gir Jordleie.no deg verktøyene du trenger for en god avtale.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-benefits-grid">

        <!-- Landowners -->
        <div class="lp-benefits-col">
          <h3>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
            For grunneiere
          </h3>
          <div class="lp-benefit-cards">
            <div class="lp-benefit-card">
              <div class="lp-benefit-icon">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="5" rx="2"/><line x1="2" y1="10" x2="22" y2="10"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="lp-benefit-title">Rettferdig markedspris</div>
                <p class="lp-benefit-desc">Auksjonssystemet sikrer at du alltid får markedspris for arealet ditt – ikke det naboen tilbyr.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-benefit-card">
              <div class="lp-benefit-icon">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"/><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"/><path d="M10 9H8"/><path d="M16 13H8"/><path d="M16 17H8"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="lp-benefit-title">Digital leieavtale</div>
                <p class="lp-benefit-desc">Alle avtaler inngås digitalt med riktig mal. Ingen papirarbeid, ingen usikkerhet.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-benefit-card">
              <div class="lp-benefit-icon">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="lp-benefit-title">Verifiserte leietakere</div>
                <p class="lp-benefit-desc">Alle bud kommer fra identitetsverifiserte bønder med synlig driftshistorikk.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Renters -->
        <div class="lp-benefits-col">
          <h3>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13" rx="1"/><path d="M16 8h4a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v10a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-3"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/></svg>
            For leietakere
          </h3>
          <div class="lp-benefit-cards">
            <div class="lp-benefit-card">
              <div class="lp-benefit-icon">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="3 6 9 3 15 6 21 3 21 18 15 21 9 18 3 21"/><line x1="9" y1="3" x2="9" y2="18"/><line x1="15" y1="6" x2="15" y2="21"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="lp-benefit-title">Full oversikt</div>
                <p class="lp-benefit-desc">Se jordkart, jordtype, størrelse og historikk for hvert areal – alt på ett sted.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-benefit-card">
              <div class="lp-benefit-icon">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="lp-benefit-title">Transparente vilkår</div>
                <p class="lp-benefit-desc">Alle auksjoner viser tydelig leieperiode, startbud og gjeldende bud i sanntid.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-benefit-card">
              <div class="lp-benefit-icon">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="lp-benefit-title">Finn jord nær deg</div>
                <p class="lp-benefit-desc">Filtrer på fylke, jordtype og størrelse. Finn arealer som passer akkurat din drift.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

